libxslt (1.1.43-0.3deepin2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * [CVE-2025-10911] Use a dedicated node type to maintain the list of cached
    RVTs, avoiding use-after-free when XPath traverses the cached list.
  * [CVE-2025-11731] End function node ancestor search at document to avoid
    type confusion in exsltFuncResultComp().
  * CVE-2025-7425: not-affected - mitigated by libxml2 2.14 (DSA 5990-1),
    no standalone libxslt upstream fix available.

